{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Living the Dream", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "They Say Yes!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Reported Speech and Questions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use reported speech when you are saying (reporting)  what other people said or asked. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you tell people what someone has said in the past, you need to change the verb to the next past form. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Direct speech                             </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Reported speech</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Rachel: \u201cThey <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hired</span>  him.\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She said they <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had hired </span> him.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Jill: \u201cI'<span class=\\\"strong\\\">m coming</span>  to lunch.\u201d               \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She said she <span class=\\\"strong\\\">was coming</span>. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Oliver: \u201cI already <span class=\\\"strong\\\">emailed </span> them.\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He said he <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had already </span> emailed them.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Beth: \u201cI<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> can </span> get you a job.\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She told me she <span class=\\\"strong\\\">could </span> get me a job.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adam: \u201cWhere do you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">work </span> now?\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He asked me where I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">worked </span> now.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You have to change the pronoun if you are reporting what someone else said. Compare these two sentences. In each case the person actually said \"I don't want to go.\" <ul><li>I said, \u201cI don't want to go.\u201d  >     I said <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">I</span></span> didn't want to go.</li><li>Bill said, \u201cI don't want to go.\u201d  >  Bill said <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">he</span></span> didn't want to go.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>Look at the chart below to see the changes in verb tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":12,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Direct speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Reported speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Gail: \\\"She is my boss.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She said she was her boss.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ben: \\\"I'm coming right now.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  Past Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He said he was coming right now.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Drew: \\\"I had a lot of meetings last week.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> He said he had had a lot of meetings last week.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fiona: \\\"We've never had such a great boss.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She said they had never had such a great boss.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sam: \\\"I was wondering where you were.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Perfect Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He said he had been wondering where I had been.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "What did they say?<br/>They said they thought I would be an ideal fit for the team.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When did they say you would start?<br/> They said I would start on February 7th.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What did they say you would be doing?<br/>They said I would be an editorial assistant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Did they mention how much cash you would be making?<br/> Boris told me it would be $42,000 to start.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you want to report questions asked, the subject normally comes before the verb. <br> For example: <br> <span class=\"underline\">Direct</span>:<span class=\"italic\"> \"What are you doing?\"</span> <br> <span class=\"underline\">Indirect</span>: <span class=\"italic\">She asked me what I was doing.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When the question is a yes/no question, you use <span class=\"strong\">if </span> or <span class=\"strong\">whether </span>to report it. <br> For example: <br> <span class=\"underline\">Direct</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Is that the report you were talking about?</span> <br> <span class=\"underline\">Indirect</span>: <span class=\"italic\">He wondered if that was the report I had been talking about.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future and making future plans.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Will</span>:<br/> When you make a quick decision at the moment of speaking.<br/>To make predictions, offers, promises.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Be going to</span>:<br/> When you ask about intentions and plans.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous Tense</span>:<br/> When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Simple Present</span>:<br/> When you talk about schedules.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'll be right back.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to go to a movie tomorrow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are having dinner tomorrow at 8 p.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The bus number 17 stops at 8 o'clock every day.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Your skills and experience will be an ideal fit for our team.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I am meeting with the CEO tomorrow and will inform him then.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "As we discussed, your starting date is going to be February 8, 2016. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We are have a meeting that day at noon, so it will be a perfect time to introduce you to everyone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The starting wage will be $50,000 per year and is paid on a weekly basis.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We will discuss this in further detail upon your arrival.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ideal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "perfect", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your skills and experience will be an ideal fit for our team.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you get a new job.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sick leave", "type": "name"}, {"content": "paid sick days", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: BFP offers excellent benefits which includes vacation and sick leave.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "benefits package", "type": "name"}, {"content": "medical insurance, dental insurance and other perks offered to employees", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They said that they had a good benefits package as well. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "on a weekly basis", "type": "name"}, {"content": "every week", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Salaries are paid on a weekly basis.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "earned money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The starting wage will be $50,000 per year. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cash", "type": "name"}, {"content": "money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did they mention how much cash you would be making?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le16ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a 250 word story about your first day at a job or your first day at school.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe your feelings and emotions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What happened on your first day? Who did you meet? What did you do?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After, share your story with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using Reported Speech, your partner will then share your story with another classmate.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a story about my first day at a new job or new school.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe my feelings and emotions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use details to elaborate on the events of that first day.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use Reported Speech to tell my partner's story to another person.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"italic\">&lt;boris.brody@bfp.com&gt;</span> <br/>Boris,</p>Thank you for taking time from your busy schedule to talk to me about the position yesterday. Meeting you and your team was such a pleasure.  I appreciate the opportunity I had to learn more about\nyour company.<br/>\nFollowing our conversation, I feel even more confident that the skills and experience I have are a great match for the job on offer. I am highly enthusiastic about the prospect of joining the team.<br/>Thank you once again. I look forward to hearing from you.\n</p>Best regards,<br />Kristi<br/><span class=\"italic\">&lt;k.lenard@mail.com&gt;</span></p>"}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "38000", "id": 2, "text": "Kristi,</p>BFP is pleased to offer you the position of editorial assistant. Your skills and experience will be an ideal fit for our team. I am meeting with the CEO tomorrow and will inform him then.<br/>\nAs we discussed, your starting date is going to be February 8, 2016.<br/>\nWe are having a meeting that day at noon, so it will be a perfect time to introduce you to everyone."}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "62250", "id": 3, "text": "The starting wage will be $50,000 per year and is paid on a weekly basis.  BFP offers excellent benefits which includes vacation and sick leave.<br/>\nWe will discuss this in further detail upon your arrival.</p>\nBest regards,<br />\nBoris B.<br/>\n<span class=\"italic\">&#60;boris.brody@bfp.com&#62;</span></p>"}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img07.jpg", "time": "84500", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I got the job!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Yeah! Congrats! What did they say?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said they thought I would be an ideal fit for the team.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>:  When did they say you would start?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said I would start on February 8th.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: What did they say you would be doing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said I would be an editorial assistant.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>:  Nice! Did they mention how much cash you would be making?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Boris told me it would be $50,000 to start.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Oh. Well that's ok for an entry level position.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said that they had a good benefits package as well.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Oh! I'm so excited for you!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le16ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le16ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about events and experiences related to jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss future plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report what someone had previously said. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How did you feel when you got your first job?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What happened on your first day at work or school?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "You got the job!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Kristi got an <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\">entry level position</span>  at a big company. She is very excited!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "An <span class=\"italic\">\u201centry level position\u201d</span>  is the lowest level job in a company.", "tip_id": 1, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nKristi finds out when she starts.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "g